rate your lodges with furniture pre-bought and crafted. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook for lodgers from a variety of recipes. Either to orders or just hand out wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers will rate their stay and leave messages and star ratings in the Town hall guestbook. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests from the games characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers participate in holiday activities such as fishing, exploring the mountains, hosting BBQ's and Water skiing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canoes and speedboats help you get around quickly or take a Skycar up into the mountains. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave enabled (configurable) - no need to sleep and rest-up energy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon woodland creatures to help you cut trees, harvest crops and fast travel across the world map.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Throneroom Interactive LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160420/14940ecae69cb6d5a0dc1b525e9194f52ab8bba0/header.jpg?t=1772568886","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3 (Arch-based)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 550 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3 (Arch-based)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Zen 2 4c/8t, 2.4-3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 RDNA 2 CUs, 1.6GHz<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 550 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirement